abstract: >-
  An Android application that collects inertial sensor data
  (accelerometer and gyroscope) alongside GPS location
  readings, visualized on a Google Maps interface. This app
  is designed to support research on cognitive architectures
  by providing sensor-logging capabilities for mobile
  environments.
